---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Careers - ChooseVS"
  description="Join the ChooseVS team. Explore career opportunities and help us build the best comparison platform on the internet."
>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-accent-500 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-surface-900 mb-4">Join Our Team</h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-surface-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            We're building the most helpful comparison platform on the internet, and we're always looking for talented people who share our passion for clarity, accuracy, and great user experiences.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 md:p-12 mb-12">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 mb-4">We're Growing — Check Back Soon!</h2>
          <p class="text-surface-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            ChooseVS is a young and rapidly growing platform. While we don't have any open positions posted at this moment, we're always interested in connecting with exceptional people — writers, researchers, designers, developers, and anyone who believes in our mission of making better decisions accessible to everyone.
          </p>
          <p class="text-surface-600 leading-relaxed">
            If you'd like to be considered for future opportunities, we'd love to hear from you. Send us your resume and a brief note about what excites you about ChooseVS.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
          <div class="card p-6 text-left">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">Remote-First</h3>
            <p class="text-surface-600 text-sm">We're a fully distributed team. Work from anywhere with an internet connection.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6 text-left">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">Mission-Driven</h3>
            <p class="text-surface-600 text-sm">Join a team that genuinely cares about helping people make better decisions.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6 text-left">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">Learn & Grow</h3>
            <p class="text-surface-600 text-sm">We invest in our team's development with learning budgets and mentorship.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 to-accent-50 border-primary-200">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 mb-4">Interested in Joining Us?</h2>
          <p class="text-surface-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Even if there are no current openings that match your background, we'd love to hear from you. Send your resume and a brief introduction to:
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:hello@choosevs.com" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            hello@choosevs.com
          </a>
          <p class="text-surface-500 text-sm mt-4">
            Please include "Careers" in the subject line of your email.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
